{{Quote|This ship is everything to Hype.|[[Torra Doza]], to [[Kazuda Xiono]]|<ref name="The Disappeared">{{Resistance|The Disappeared}}</ref>}}
The '''''Green Ace'''''<ref name="USWNE" /> was a modified [[G30 racing starfighter|G30]]<ref name="The High Tower" /> [[Starship|ship]] [[pilot]]ed by [[Hype Fazon]]. The racer's wings could shift angles for maximum maneuverability while flying. It was plastered with the logos of Fazon's sponsors.<ref name="USWNE" /> The two largest were painted on each wing, and included inscriptions in [[Aurebesh]]: "[[Outer Rim Supply Co.]]" on the left wing, and "[[Craft Repair and Maintenance]]" on the right wing,<ref name="High Tower BL">{{SW|url=news/buckets-list-extra-the-high-tower-star-wars-resistance|text=Bucket's List Extra: 9 Fun Facts from "The High Tower" - ''Star Wars Resistance''|date=2018-10-29}}</ref> which were advertisements.<ref name="USWNE" />

The racer also carried armament in the form of [[laser cannon]]s and [[missile launcher]]s.<ref name="Bibo" /> Fazon kept the ship in his [[Hype Fazon's hangar bay|personal hangar]] aboard the ''Colossus''.<ref name="The Disappeared" />

==Behind the scenes==
Most of the logos covering the ship made their first appearance in various episodes of the series ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' and ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''.<ref name="High Tower BL" />

